<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sv">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <base href="/" />
    <ResourcePreloader />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="@Assets["_content/AkeroGarden.Web.Core/css/site.css"]" />
    @* No scoped-CSS bundle link: the project has no .razor.css files (the reconnect dialog's, the
       last one, moved into site.css on 2026-10-03), so the bundle is never generated and the link
       would 404 — as the public host's App.razor already notes. Add it back only with a scoped sheet. *@
    <ImportMap />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="_content/AkeroGarden.Web.Core/logo/favicon.png" />
    <HeadOutlet />
</head>

<body>
    <Routes />
    <ReconnectModal />
    <script src="@Assets["_framework/blazor.web.js"]"></script>
    @* Keeps --admin-topbar-h equal to the topbar's real height, so .detail-rail sticks below
       it rather than below a guess. Host-wide because the topbar is on every admin page and
       its height varies with the page title/actions. *@
    <script src="@Assets["_content/AkeroGarden.Web.Core/js/sticky-offsets.js"]"></script>
</body>

</html>
